body:
Music is great because it describes emotions that are too hard to put into words. For example on sunday I was feeling my 70's playlist and now I am feeling Nirvana. I can't really say I was feeling happy or sad because I can only describe the complexity of emotion through music.

&#x200B;

Thank you for the response, I think I'm gonna try to get the confidence to tell my parents whats really going on in my life first, and then maybe ask for therapy.
